p>You have successfully subscribed to our membership plan. </p><p>Your account already setup and ready to configure.</p><p>Kindly follow the below the link to visit your dashboard.</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42450,'wcfm_membership_subscription_thankyou_content','<p><strong>Welcome,</strong></p><p>You have successfully submitted your Vendor Account request. </p><p>Your Vendor application is still under review.</p><p>You will receive details about our decision in your email very soon!</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42451,'wcfm_non_membership_welcome_email_subject','[{site_name}] Successfully Registered','yes'),(42452,'wcfm_non_membership_welcome_email_content','<p>Dear {first_name},</p><p>You have successfully registered as a vendor for <b>{site_name}</b>.</p><p>Your account has been setup and it is ready to be configured.</p><p>Kindly follow the link below to visit your dashboard and start selling.</p><p>Dashboard: {dashboard_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42453,'wcfm_membership_subscription_welcome_email_subject','[{site_name}] Successfully Subscribed','yes'),(42454,'wcfm_membership_subscription_welcome_email_content','<p>Dear {first_name},</p><p>You have successfully registered as a vendor for <b>{site_name}</b>.</p><p>Your account has been setup and it is ready to be configured.</p><p>{plan_details}</p><p>Kindly follow the link below to visit your dashboard and start selling.</p><p>Dashboard: {dashboard_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42455,'wcfm_registration_admin_notication_subject','[{site_name}] A new vendor registered','yes'),(42456,'wcfm_registration_admin_notication_content','<p>Dear Admin,</p><p>A new vendor <b>{vendor_name}</b> (Store: <b>{vendor_store}</b>) successfully registered to our site. </p><p>Kindly follow the below the link to more details.</p><p>Dashboard: {vendor_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42457,'wcfm_membership_subscription_admin_notication_subject','[{site_name}] A new vendor registered','yes'),(42458,'wcfm_membership_subscription_admin_notication_content','<p>Dear Admin,</p><p>A new vendor <b>{vendor_name}</b> (Store: <b>{vendor_store}</b>) successfully subscribed to membership plan <b>{membership_plan}</b>. </p><p>{plan_details}</p><p>Kindly follow the below the link to more details.</p><p>Dashboard: {vendor_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42459,'wcfm_membership_onapproval_admin_notication_subject','[{site_name}] A vendor application waiting for approval','yes'),(42460,'wcfm_membership_onapproval_admin_notication_content','<p>Dear Admin,</p><p>A new vendor <b>{vendor_name}</b> (Store: <b>{vendor_store}</b>) has just applied to our membership plan <b>{membership_plan}</b>. </p><p>Kindly follow the below the link to approve/reject the application.</p><p>Application: {notification_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42461,'wcfm_membership_switch_admin_notication_subject','[{site_name}] Vendor Membership Subscription Change','yes'),(42462,'wcfm_membership_switch_admin_notication_content','<p>Dear Admin,</p><p><b>{vendor_name}</b> (Store: <b>{vendor_store}</b>) has changed membership plan to <b>{membership_plan}</b>. </p><p>{plan_details}</p><p>Kindly follow the below the link to more details.</p><p>Dashboard: {vendor_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42463,'wcfm_membership_switch_notication_subject','[{site_name}] Membership Subscription Successfully Changed','yes'),(42464,'wcfm_membership_switch_notication_content','<p>Hi {first_name},</p><p>You have successfully changed membership plan to <b>{membership_plan}</b>. </p><p>Your account already setup and ready to configure.</p><p>{plan_details}</p><p>Kindly follow the below the link to visit your dashboard.</p><p>Dashboard: {dashboard_url}</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42465,'wcfm_membership_next_payment_notication_subject','{site_name}: Membership Subscription Recurring Next Payment','yes'),(42466,'wcfm_membership_next_payment_notication_content','<p>Hi {vendor_name},</p><p>Your membership plan (<strong>{membership_plan}</strong>) subscription next billing date <strong>{next_payment_day}</strong>. </p><p>Kindly pay now now to keep your account active.</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42467,'wcfm_membership_reminder_notication_subject','{site_name}: Membership Subscription Renewal Reminder','yes'),(42468,'wcfm_membership_reminder_notication_content','<p>Hi {vendor_name},</p><p>Your membership plan (<strong>{membership_plan}</strong>) will expire <strong>{reminder_day}</strong>. </p><p>Kindly renew now to keep your account active.</p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42469,'wcfm_membership_reject_notication_subject','[{site_name}] Vendor Application Rejected','yes'),(42470,'wcfm_membership_reject_notication_content','<p>Hi {first_name},</p><p>Sorry to inform you that, your vendor application has been rejected. </p><p><strong><i>{rejection_reason}</i></strong></p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42471,'wcfm_membership_cancel_notication_subject','[{site_name}] Membership Subscription Cancelled','yes'),(42472,'wcfm_membership_cancel_notication_content','<p>Hi {vendor_name},</p><p>Your membership plan (<strong>{membership_plan}</strong>) has been cancelled. </p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42473,'wcfm_membership_expire_notication_subject','[{site_name}] Membership Subscription Expired','yes'),(42474,'wcfm_membership_expire_notication_content','<p>Hi {vendor_name},</p><p>Your membership plan (<strong>{membership_plan}</strong>) has been expired. </p><p>Thank You</p>','yes'),(42475,'wcfmvm_style_custom','wcfmvm-style-custom-1673092918.css','yes'),(42476,'wcfmvm_style_custom_subscribe_button','wcfmvm-style-custom-subscribe-button-1673092918.css','yes'),(42477,'wcfm_pay_for_product_settings','a:4:{s:4:\"cost\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"credit\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"default_limit\";s:6:\"by_cap\";s:7:\"product\";i:681;}','yes'),(42622,'using_application_passwords','1','no'),(42672,'_transient_wcfm-notification-message-3','1','yes'),(42673,'_transient_wcfm-notification-enquiry-3','0','yes'),(54093,'_transient_wcfm-notification-message-9','1','yes'),(54